+- In addition, the pinned workflow of §32.2 is dispatched once with `F` and the configuration path as inputs and T1″ as
+  `X`, for the commands of §32.4 items 1–13 and the candidate part of item 14. Every one must pass as stated in §32.4.
+  The first such run is also the tool's positive real-host admission control.
